{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Bury in the choicest of our graves.</b> Do not let your dead linger until you acquire [a burial plot], as they said of blessed memory (Mo'ed Qatan 22a): whoever delays [burial of] any of the dead — for all the dead — and removes him from his bed, this is praiseworthy."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:11.919816099Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}